{"1407050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Batterneers", "steam_appid": 1407050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Batterneers is an exciting, action-packed game for up to 4 players. Fight across a number of different maps and game modes using a range of abilities and powerups.<br><br><i>Do note that as of now, Batterneers only supports online and LAN multiplayer. Local multiplayer is currently not available.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407050/extras/9f80cf699e4c20d00676a8b7c826b689.avif?t=1609797077\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><u>Battle Across a Range of Different Game Modes</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Deathmatch</strong> - Fight to be the last one standing with the highest score in this classic game mode.<br></li><li> <strong>Gem Chase</strong> - Hold onto the precious gem for as long as you can while avoiding your fellow players.<br></li><li> <strong>Treasure Hunt</strong> - Collect the most treasure to win the game! But watch out, as other players can try to sabotage you.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407050/extras/2ab078c329bea0884be5a1ee0f6d8d06.avif?t=1609797077\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><u>Choose Your Approach to Combat</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cannons</strong> - In order to be the best, you'll need to learn how to fire your cannons, calculate the trajectory and use a range of unique powerups to your advantage. These include tracking balls, boomerangs, summoning the kraken, sun beams, explosives and more!<br></li><li> <strong>Bombs</strong> - The most dangerous weapon in Batterneers. Bombs can be picked up and thrown at pursuing enemies, but watch out as just one rogue cannon ball can make everything go wrong.<br></li><li> <strong>Ship</strong> - Using the right powerups, your ship can be as deadly as any weapon in the game. Spikes, ocean swirls and rapid reloading will make anyone run away in fear.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "Batterneers is an exciting, action-packed game for up to 4 players. Fight across a number of different maps and game modes using a range of abilities and powerups.<br><br><i>Do note that as of now, Batterneers only supports online and LAN multiplayer. Local multiplayer is currently not available.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407050/extras/9f80cf699e4c20d00676a8b7c826b689.avif?t=1609797077\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><u>Battle Across a Range of Different Game Modes</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Deathmatch</strong> - Fight to be the last one standing with the highest score in this classic game mode.<br></li><li> <strong>Gem Chase</strong> - Hold onto the precious gem for as long as you can while avoiding your fellow players.<br></li><li> <strong>Treasure Hunt</strong> - Collect the most treasure to win the game! But watch out, as other players can try to sabotage you.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407050/extras/2ab078c329bea0884be5a1ee0f6d8d06.avif?t=1609797077\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><u>Choose Your Approach to Combat</u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cannons</strong> - In order to be the best, you'll need to learn how to fire your cannons, calculate the trajectory and use a range of unique powerups to your advantage. These include tracking balls, boomerangs, summoning the kraken, sun beams, explosives and more!<br></li><li> <strong>Bombs</strong> - The most dangerous weapon in Batterneers. Bombs can be picked up and thrown at pursuing enemies, but watch out as just one rogue cannon ball can make everything go wrong.<br></